#undef NDEBUG
// Review HK: the Petri alignment workbench and the POWL net's token replay
// keyed by a typed attribute or column.
//
// - /api/align-petri-workbench aligns as pm4py's log alignments dispatcher
//   (the easy-soundness check, then every trace's key, the best-worst cost,
//   each variant in order; state equation A* by default), with standard
//   costs as /api/align's supplied model; a log or synchronous move on a
//   blank label is a move. Keyed by an attribute or column of other objects
//   than text, each adapter reads pm4py's objects (XES: read_xes' legacy
//   objects for log and stream, the DataFrame's cells for dataframe, their
//   Polars copy for lazyframe; CSV: the formatted frame's cells, the Polars
//   copy's String of an object column): the trace-net searches raise
//   "can only concatenate str" at the first object that is no str, the
//   less-memory search sorts each trace's objects (TypeError for two kinds),
//   and an object never meets the PNML's text labels.
// - /api/mine's POWL keyed by such an attribute mines the objects in
//   Python's order, objects equal as dict keys one activity (KeyError for an
//   event without the key, TypeError when the set of objects does not
//   sort), and its replay keyed the same meets the net's labels.
//
// Expected values are pm4py 2.7.22 black-box on the same inputs
// (review-harness round-hk: tc/mkhk.py, ct/wb.py, ct/pw.py).
//
// Usage: minera_server_review_hk_tests <minera_server>
